#requires -Version 5.1
# StockFlow Role Alignment: role-scoped dashboard, API visibility and employee roles.
# Designed for installation immediately after Install-StockFlow-Roles.ps1.
# Does not read or alter MongoDB data; keeps original theme and profile.
